              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Jack Daniel's Properties, Inc., jack Daniel's Properties, Inc. argued that VIP\u2019s \u201cBad Spaniels\u201d dog toy copies Jack Daniel\u2019s trademark and trade dress and associates its whiskey with dog poop, constituting infringement and dilution."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "MS. BLATT",
          "citations": [
