            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The decision clarifies that a parody does not automatically exempt a product from trademark infringement under the Lanham Act."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "45a1d9a2e608ac47828291ce48d6a830256f15642804891e3f6a9157452eb597",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-45a1d9a2e608-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 24,
              "start": 24
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "It limits the scope of the \u201cnon\u2011commercial use\u201d defense, affecting future cases involving parodic uses of trademarks."
      }
